# ADV-283: SCI's blind-checked sentences S1 to S3 (RESULT_ADV283_SCI_20261125.md section 5), verbatim, then the like-for-like limit.
S = (" [IT 2026-11-25, ADV-283, SCI's blind-checked wording] "
     "In two mouse tissues of one study (GSE158681 hippocampus, GSE158682 cortex; P17; gene TPM = sum of the gene's transcripts; n is the library, assumed one animal each) Pdk3 does not meet the anchor-size rule (ratio of arm means 1.2 or more with every deficient library above every control library) in either primary comparison: global null KO against wild type hippocampus 0.689 (n 2 v 3, all knockout below), neuron-targeted KO against control cortex 1.020 (n 3 v 4, overlapping). Secondary arms: Synapsin-Cre hippocampus 1.089 (n 3 v 2, overlapping), nestin-Cre hippocampus 0.913 (n 2 v 2). The 1.55 times of GSE156243 (a CPM ratio, 4 v 2 libraries; raw counts 1.75) is therefore not replicated in these mouse tissues and rests on one deposit. Every deficient arm has fewer oligodendrocyte transcripts (Plp1 0.17 to 0.49 of control) and more Gfap (1.6 to 4.3 times), so each ratio is a whole-tissue mixture ratio. "
     "Pdk1 meets the lower rule (ratio 0.83 or less with every deficient library below every control) only in the Synapsin-Cre hippocampus arm (0.661; n 3 v 2), where Pdk3 is 1.089 with overlapping libraries (25.24 below the control 25.70); the pattern is therefore absent only under the stated rule. In the cortex Pdk1 is 0.805, which meets the ratio limit but not the ordering (knockout 8.91 and 6.40 above control 4.30 and 5.74); global null 0.943; nestin-Cre 1.047. "
     "In GSE126075 (one shRNA-silenced and one untreated sample per cell type, merged CAGE TPM by gene symbol) the neuron pair's column totals differ about threefold (89,581 against 264,496), every gene in the silenced neuron sample is lower by a median 0.36, and WWOX CAGE signal is 1.15 times control in hNSC and 0.20 in neurons. The neuron PDK ratios (PDK3 0.33, PDK1 0.48) sit at that library-wide shift; for hNSC PDK1 is 0.69 and PDK3 0.91 (n of 1, no WWOX depletion in the signal). Descriptive only; not counted toward support or failure. "
     "The mouse arms are not a like-for-like test of the human organoid.")
e("U06", E03, "append", "EXPLORATORY NEGATIVES: transcripts are not PDH activity", S)
e("U07", I01, "append", "The maturity confound of this deposit applies.", S)

